        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate Hololive hide-and-seek adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of coziness and colorful cuteness in <strong>Holo Hidden</strong>, a charming hidden object game where your favorite <strong>Hololivers'</strong> are trying to find their hidden fans and missing items!<br>It’s your job to find <i>hundreds</i> of hidden fans &amp; items scattered across 11<strong> beautifully hand-drawn levels (plus 1 bonus level!)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3f2cc8c46f8f613e2949b53980659804.poster.avif?t=1758876710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3f2cc8c46f8f613e2949b53980659804.webm?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3f2cc8c46f8f613e2949b53980659804.mp4?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is packed with illustrations, hundreds of hidden items, and some references to your favourite hololivers. Whether you're spotting chumbuds in a messy room or locating a missing donuts in a fuwamoco's favourite donut shop, there’s always a new surprise around the corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3081470e36ffcc452fb693176d45e300.poster.avif?t=1758876710\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3081470e36ffcc452fb693176d45e300.webm?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/3081470e36ffcc452fb693176d45e300.mp4?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cute, cozy art</strong> featuring beloved Hololive members.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Hundreds of items</strong> to find — from obvious to  well hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 11<strong> (+1) levels</strong>, each hundreds of hidden items and many references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 Chill soundtrack and comfy vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 Photo &amp; Colouring mode for those creative minds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of Hololive, hidden object lovers, or anyone who enjoys a relaxing chill game. Grab your magnifying glass and start clicking — those hidden fans  won't find themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/e31f0c53a1e4e16d030580efbd65be53.poster.avif?t=1758876710\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/e31f0c53a1e4e16d030580efbd65be53.webm?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904810/extras/e31f0c53a1e4e16d030580efbd65be53.mp4?t=1758876710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(※1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(※2) This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;. Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed. ※1. About CCMC Corp. CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: Steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp. ※2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot; holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators. It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games. For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p>",
